#14900
The Ancient Road~
This is a small area, representing an ancient road leading to the Great Tower
of Xerxes from the Great Eastern Desert. The road winds along a dry gorge
until it reaches a plateau upon which lies the Tower itself. I have no further
plans for this particular area itself, feel free to extend it if you wish.
Bear in mind thou, that Xerxes would not tolerate another major power close
to him.

The connection points are as follows:
West of 14925 is connected to 5062 (the rope bridge).
South of 14901 is connected to 14001 (Entrance to the Great Tower of Xerxes).

This area was written by Vex.
~
